{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00702",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.35,
      "end_seconds": 12.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.14,
      "text": "Hello. It's probably nothing. I had COVID last month, and I feel run down, that's all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.29,
      "end_seconds": 20.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "How long ago did you test positive? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.09,
      "end_seconds": 43.46,
      "duration_seconds": 19.37,
      "text": "Five weeks ago. I was in bed for a week, and since then I've just been flat. I used to go to the gym twice a week and I can't face it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.68,
      "end_seconds": 53.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Is it tiredness, or low energy, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.07,
      "end_seconds": 61.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Tired by mid-afternoon, mostly. Not sleepy exactly, just heavy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.97,
      "end_seconds": 70.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Any fever, cough or breathlessness left over?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.12,
      "end_seconds": 79.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "No fever, no cough, and my breathing's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.0,
      "end_seconds": 87.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "What are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.19,
      "end_seconds": 103.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.24,
      "text": "Ferrous sulphate, 200 mg once a day, since my iron was low last year. And vitamin D, 1000 units, every day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.97,
      "end_seconds": 110.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Good. Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.72,
      "end_seconds": 115.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "None, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.14,
      "end_seconds": 123.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "What conditions do you have?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.39,
      "end_seconds": 131.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Iron deficiency anaemia, last year. And migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.25,
      "end_seconds": 136.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Any operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.71,
      "end_seconds": 145.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Just my tonsils out, when I was seven."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.27,
      "end_seconds": 158.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Gentle exercise has been part of your routine, so I understand why you feel the loss. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.67,
      "end_seconds": 167.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "It's the thing that keeps me sane. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.44,
      "end_seconds": 179.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Given your history, I wonder if your iron has dropped again after being ill. Heavy periods? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.91,
      "end_seconds": 187.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Not unusual for me, yes. A bit heavy lately. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.15,
      "end_seconds": 203.77,
      "duration_seconds": 11.62,
      "text": "That would make sense. I think this is most likely low iron again, on top of the after-effects of the virus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.44,
      "end_seconds": 210.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Can that be checked? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.81,
      "end_seconds": 225.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.05,
      "text": "Yes, I'd like to arrange a blood test, to check your iron stores, your blood count and your thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.12,
      "end_seconds": 231.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "When? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.97,
      "end_seconds": 241.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Today, if you can pop in to the nurse after this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.0,
      "end_seconds": 248.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "I can. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.38,
      "end_seconds": 262.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "Meanwhile, get gentle exercise back slowly, a walk, not the gym, and eat iron-rich foods, with something with vitamin C."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.09,
      "end_seconds": 269.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Like spinach and orange juice? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.68,
      "end_seconds": 280.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Spot on. Don't take your iron tablet with tea or coffee, it blocks absorption."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.25,
      "end_seconds": 288.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Ah, I do that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.5,
      "end_seconds": 300.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, when the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.65,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Two weeks. Fine. ~"
    }
  ]
}
